  "label": "Meme Structure: Self-Referential Humor",
  "description": "The meme uses a common internet humor technique where the subject (the man) is playfully or ironically framed as if he is 'going back' to the Hall of Fame, implying he is being honored or is returning for a second time. This requires understanding of internet meme culture and the use of self-referential or ironic phrasing to create humor.",
